              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ലേഖകൻ — lēkhakan — \"a correspondent; a writer\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പത്രത്തിന്റെ ലേഖകൻ ഗ്രാമത്തിൽ എത്തി. patrattinṟe lēkhakan grāmattil etti. The newspaper's correspondent reached the village."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A woman writer or correspondent is ലേഖിക. A correspondent writes about events: ലേഖകൻ (lēkhakan) ആഘോഷം കണ്ടു, the correspondent saw the celebration."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
