          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ലേഖകൻ (lēkhakan) is borrowed from Sanskrit lekhaka, \"a writer, a scribe, a clerk\" (Monier-Williams), with the Malayalam masculine ending -ൻ. It belongs to the same family as ലേഖനം (lēkhanaṁ), \"an article\"."
            }
          ]
        },
