          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പ്രഖ്യാപിക്കുക — prakhyāpikkuka — \"to announce; to declare\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പ്രിൻസിപ്പൽ നാളെ അവധി പ്രഖ്യാപിച്ചു. prinsippal nāḷe avadhi prakhyāpiccu. The principal announced a holiday for tomorrow."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: പ്രഖ്യാപിച്ചു, prakhyāpiccu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A formal word, common in the news. The noun is പ്രഖ്യാപനം, an announcement. ആഘോഷത്തിന് അവധി പ്രഖ്യാപിച്ചു: a holiday was declared for the celebration."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പ്രഖ്യാപിക്കുക (prakhyāpikkuka) is built from Sanskrit prakhyāpana, \"making known, a report\" (Monier-Williams), with the Malayalam verb ending -ിക്കുക. The Sanskrit noun comes from the verb pra-khyā, \"to announce, to proclaim\"."
            }
